{"type":"beat","id":"beat_483a24f40ea072c6ecbd2655","text":"The atrium of the {Last Library} breathed dust and morning light as {Maya Chen} crossed the tiled floor. The mezzanine loomed with shadows, and the old clock thudded in the rafters. A page slipped a note between catalogs.","file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","line":4,"section":{"act":"Chapter 1","scene":"The Meeting"},"entities":["Last Library","Maya Chen"],"added":"2025-10-03T16:39:11.636120+00:00","source":"imported","provenance":{"source_file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","source_line":4,"normalization_steps":["normalize_beat_text"]}}
{"type":"beat","id":"beat_90980a82977e5f30acdcd7be","text":"\"Check the index vault,\" it read. {Maya Chen} folded it once and watched for {?Kai}. If the rumors were true, the {?Night District} would seal again at dusk.","file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","line":6,"section":{"act":"Chapter 1","scene":"The Meeting"},"entities":["Maya Chen"],"added":"2025-10-03T16:39:11.637132+00:00","source":"imported","provenance":{"source_file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","source_line":6,"normalization_steps":["normalize_beat_text"]}}
{"type":"beat","id":"beat_ae4098a719997db0e4fe9216","text":"{Maya Chen} is determined to recover the lost index.","file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","line":8,"section":{"act":"Chapter 1","scene":"The Meeting"},"entities":["Maya Chen"],"added":"2025-10-03T16:39:11.638083+00:00","source":"imported","provenance":{"source_file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","source_line":8,"normalization_steps":["normalize_beat_text"]}}
{"type":"beat","id":"beat_30e67d29831513176228c352","text":"The {?Sentinel Guards} entered with the muted stomp of heavy boots. Questions, then warnings. \"Restricted sections are off-limits,\" they said. {Maya Chen} nodded and drifted toward shelf {?C-17}.","file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","line":12,"section":{"act":"Chapter 1","scene":"The Interruption"},"entities":["Maya Chen"],"added":"2025-10-03T16:39:11.639035+00:00","source":"imported","provenance":{"source_file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","source_line":12,"normalization_steps":["normalize_beat_text"]}}
{"type":"beat","id":"beat_60aa0e4b93e3f5d0df6da382","text":"Behind a row of crumbling folios, her fingers found a hidden map scratched into the wood: a route beneath the {?Night District}, toward a vault that hummed like a living thing.","file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","line":14,"section":{"act":"Chapter 1","scene":"The Interruption"},"entities":[],"added":"2025-10-03T16:39:11.640014+00:00","source":"imported","provenance":{"source_file":"tests/notes_corpus/plain/novel.md","source_line":14,"normalization_steps":["normalize_beat_text"]}}
